---
// src/components/bangalore/MonthlyService.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-blue-600 w-full text-white border-y border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Wrong charges don't stop after one month.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-100 font-bold bg-slate-900 inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded">
        New offers, new penalties, new cuts, every week.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-md p-8 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200 shadow-xl">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-8 border-b-4 border-slate-900 pb-4">
        What we do for restaurants, every month
      </h3>
      
      <ul class="space-y-4 mb-10">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg">Every order checked against the payment and your bank, every week</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg">Every wrong charge claimed back, with proof</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg">A profit report for each outlet, every month</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg">Your books kept up to date by chartered accountants</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg">GST and TDS filed on time</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg">Staff salaries and payroll handled</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg">One team for all your accounts, one number to call</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="#free-check" class="inline-block bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-indigo-600 font-black text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded border border-slate-200 shadow-xl transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1">
          Start with a free one-month check
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
